          "ImageDescription": {
            "value": "Camera <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/zoom_burst\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:zoom burst\">zoom burst</a>, centering on the letter \"U\", on a black Microsoft Wired 600 computer keyboard with Swedish language characters. This is one photo, not a double exposure, made with tiny pauses at the start and end of the shot to make the letters slightly more distinct at those points. The keyboard was lit by two normal desk lamps. Different zoom speeds, starting and ending points were explored, giving <a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Category:Computer_keyboard_zoom_bursts\" title=\"Category:Computer keyboard zoom bursts\">widely different patterns and effects</a>. The zoom lens' full range (18-55mm) was used. Photographed in Tuntorp, Brastad, Lysekil Municipality, Sweden.",
            "source": "commons-desc-page"
